    {
      "text": "Cook four latkes at a time. For each latke, spread 1/4 cup potato mixture into a 3 1/2-inch circle in the hot skillet. Cook for 4 to 5 minutes, turning once. Repeat with remaining potato mixture, adding more oil to the skillet as needed. Season with salt and pepper if desired.",
